# Stack Selection Decision Template

Purpose:
  Template for project technology stack decisions.
  Every project MUST have a stack selection decision with
  pros/cons analysis for each option.

Schema:
  id: DEC-<ID>
  type: technical
  status: proposed|approved|rejected|implemented|verified

  project: <project_name>
  title: Stack selection for <project>

  requirements:
    - <requirement 1>
    - <requirement 2>

  options:
    - stack: <stack name>
      components:
        backend: <technology>
        frontend: <technology>
        database: <technology>
        cache: <technology>
        messaging: <technology>
      pros:
        - <pro>
      cons:
        - <con>
      compatibility: <score 0-100>
      team_familiarity: <score 0-100>
      community_support: <score 0-100>

  decision: <chosen stack>
  rationale: <why this stack>

  impact:
    files: [list]
    modules: [list]
    risks: [R0-R5]

  owner: <human or agent>
  reviewers: [list]
  approved_by: <who approved>
  approved_at: <timestamp>

  implementation:
    tasks: [TASK ids]
    status: pending|in_progress|completed

  verification:
    criteria: [how to verify]
    status: pending|passed|failed

  created_at: <timestamp>
  updated_at: <timestamp>

Template:
  Decision: DEC-XXX
  Type: technical
  Status: proposed

  Project: <project_name>
  Title: Stack selection for <project>

  Requirements:
    - <functional requirement>
    - <non-functional requirement>
    - <constraint>

  Options:
    1. <Stack A>
       Backend: <technology>
       Frontend: <technology>
       Database: <technology>
       Pros:
         - <pro>
       Cons:
         - <con>
       Compatibility: <score>
       TeamFamiliarity: <score>
       CommunitySupport: <score>

    2. <Stack B>
       ...

  Decision:
    <chosen stack>

  Rationale:
    <why this option>

  Impact:
    Files: [list]
    Modules: [list]
    Risks: [R0-R5]

  Owner: <human or agent>
  Reviewers: [list]

  Implementation:
    Tasks: [TASK ids]
    Status: pending

  Verification:
    Criteria: [list]
    Status: pending

  Created_At: <timestamp>
  Updated_At: <timestamp>

State: +
